  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供操作系统 Shell 扩展能力，包括在 Finder/Explorer 中显示文件、打开外部 URL、获取文件图标、读取系统环境变量、执行系统级操作等功能。",
    "en-US": "OS shell extensions including reveal in Finder/Explorer, open external URLs, get file icons, read system environment variables, and perform system-level operations."
  },
